{"organizer_id": "{{org}}", "marketing_push": false, "marketing_whatsapp": false}

### 7.12 Nadia picks "Tarif membres" -> 409 MEMBERS_ONLY {field, member_joined_before: null, paid_required: true}
### ("Tarif réservé aux membres à jour de cotisation")
POST {{base}}/fan/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{nadiaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id": {{m1}}, "channel": "APP", "items": [{"price_category_id": "{{membersId}}", "qty": 1,
  "holders": [{"name": "Nadia Berrada"}]}]}

### 7.13 B14: the cotisation -> figures {paid_members: 1, revenue_mad: 20000}
GET {{base}}/org/products/{{cardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{orgToken}}
X-Organizer-Id: {{org}}

### ---------- a pass ticket transferred ----------

### 8.1 Yazid transfers his match 2 ticket to Hamza -> 201 {transfer_id, to_label}
POST {{base}}/fan/tickets/{{yazidM2Ticket}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{yazidToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to_phone": "{{hamzaPhone}}", "name": "Hamza Chraibi"}

### 8.2 OPS: match 2's tickets held by Hamza (Yazid no longer sees the new one) -> 1 VALID, transferred_from set
POST {{base}}/org/events/{{m2}}/tickets/search
Authorization: Bearer {{orgToken}}
X-Organizer-Id: {{org}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"q": "{{hamzaPhone}}"}

### 8.3 Hamza: code
POST {{base}}/fan/auth/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "{{hamzaPhone}}"}

### 8.4 Hamza: verify
POST {{base}}/fan/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "{{hamzaPhone}}", "code": "{{code}}"}

> {% client.global.set("hamzaToken", response.body.token); %}

### 8.5 Hamza's tickets -> match 2, pass_id null (no "Abonnement" chip). Then (8): run check.sql (header): no rows.
GET {{base}}/fan/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{hamzaToken}}
